      "id": 19235,
      "name": "Tubafolk",
      "username": "Tubafolk",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/d07c76/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2019-06-04T04:50:21.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Okay so my players got me turned around fairly bad on a topic that I need&nbsp;to ask around on, this also came from the !reaction command on the Omni-bot.&nbsp;&nbsp;When using “Inherent”&nbsp;&nbsp;or “Reaction” actions typically is suggests an power to use. An example from Absolute Zero’s sheet...</p>\n<p>”Whenever your personal zone changes, you may Boost using&nbsp;Cold.”</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The question is this: Would you only role the die assigned to the power “cold” (d12) or would you roll three die as you would in an overcome.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I thought it it was three up until I saw the command only asked for one die to be input on Discord.&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:52:51.054Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 7,
