      "username": "MindWanderer",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-06-04T18:30:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, that's a rules clarification that made it into the later stuff.&nbsp; The general rule is that Actions you take on your turn use 3 dice, and everything else (inherent abilities, reactions, and Out abilities) use only one die.</p>",
